# SiteTracker mobile (Expo) — STAGING env template.
#
# Copy to mobile/.env.staging (gitignored by the root .gitignore rule
# ".env.*") ONLY if you want a LOCAL Expo dev server pointed at staging.
#
# For EAS CLOUD builds this file is NOT the source of truth: the clean EAS
# build checkout does not include the gitignored .env.staging. The
# authoritative staging URL for builds is the build-profile `env` block in
# mobile/eas.json. Keep the two in sync.
#
# !! SECURITY !!
# EXPO_PUBLIC_-prefixed variables are baked into the JavaScript bundle and
# are visible to anyone with the IPA / APK. Do NOT put secrets — JWT secrets,
# API keys, OAuth client secrets, Apple / App Store Connect keys, or Expo
# tokens — in any EXPO_PUBLIC_* variable. API URLs are fine; auth happens at
# runtime via JWT.

# Staging backend API base URL. Include scheme; no trailing slash.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://sitetracker-backend-staging.fly.dev
